{
  "info": {
    "name": "Teacher Dashboard API",
    "description": "Full collection for the teacher-backend API.\n\n**Usage**\n1. Start the backend (`npm run dev`) — default `http://localhost:5000`.\n2. Run **Auth > Create First Admin** (works only once).\n3. Run **Auth > Dashboard Login** with the same email/password. The token is auto-saved to the `{{token}}` collection variable.\n4. All protected requests use `Authorization: Bearer {{token}}` via collection-level auth.\n5. Resources auto-save their `_id` to collection variables when created (`{{teacherId}}`, `{{subjectId}}`, `{{studentId}}`, `{{scheduleId}}`, `{{attendanceId}}`).\n\n**Workflow**\n- Admin → create Teacher → create Subject (assign to teacher).\n- Login as the teacher (same Dashboard Login endpoint, with teacher creds).\n- Teacher → create Student, create Schedule, submit Attendance.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "_postman_id": "6b4a2e21-5c4d-4b64-9b58-td-dashboard-001"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      { "key": "token", "value": "{{token}}", "type": "string" }
    ]
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl",        "value": "http://localhost:5000/api", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "token",          "value": "",                          "type": "string" },
    { "key": "teacherId",      "value": "",                          "type": "string" },
    { "key": "subjectId",      "value": "",                          "type": "string" },
    { "key": "studentId",      "value": "",                          "type": "string" },
    { "key": "scheduleId",     "value": "",                          "type": "string" },
    { "key": "attendanceId",   "value": "",                          "type": "string" },
    { "key": "adminEmail",     "value": "admin@school.com",          "type": "string" },
    { "key": "adminPassword",  "value": "admin123",                  "type": "string" },
    { "key": "teacherEmail",   "value": "ahmed@school.com",          "type": "string" },
    { "key": "teacherPassword","value": "teacher123",                "type": "string" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Health",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": {
          "raw": "http://localhost:5000/health",
          "protocol": "http",
          "host": ["localhost"],
          "port": "5000",
          "path": ["health"]
        }
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Create First Admin (one-time)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const res = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (res && res.token) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('token', res.token);",
                  "    console.log('Saved admin token to {{token}}');",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"name\": \"Super Admin\",\n    \"email\": \"{{adminEmail}}\",\n    \"password\": \"{{adminPassword}}\",\n    \"phone\": \"+201000000000\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/create-admin",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "create-admin"]
            },
            "description": "Creates the first admin account. Fails with 409 if an admin already exists in the database."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Dashboard Login (admin)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
